async function legacyLoadAnimation(){let e=$('legend-choice').value;if(e){packet(await api('/api/item?edition='+e),+e);anim=await api('/collection/animations/'+String(e).padStart(4,'0')+'.frames.json')}else{if(!current)throw Error('Construct an entity first.');anim=await api('/api/animation',{id:current.id,reveal:!current.genome.animation.enabled});edition=0}frame=0;playing=false;$('play').textContent='Play';$('timeline').max=anim.frames.length-1;$('animation-name').textContent=anim.profile==='STATIC'?'Interactive reconstruction reveal':anim.profile;$('animation-facts').textContent=anim.frames.length+' native frames\n'+anim.fps+' FPS · '+anim.seconds+' second loop\n30 columns × 30 rows\nStable 3D surface identities\nCanonical ASCII + grayscale luminance';$('animation-facts').style.whiteSpace='pre-line';draw()}
